{"id":"u-175a62a5-5aee-467b-a13a-b9c3bd64464a","src":"community","title":"Full body Dumbell Only Push Pull","author":"Carisa Aguilar Meraz","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/osfczJ-full-body-dumbell-only-push-pull-supersets","desc":"This workout program is designed to maximize hypertrophy and overall muscle development efficiently using dumbbells and a flat bench using the least amount of excercises possible to be accessible for beginners. By incorporating some compound movements and strategic supersets, the program ensures balanced strength gains across major muscle groups while optimizing time and intensity.  \n\nTips for Hypertrophy:\nControlled Eccentric Phase: Lower the weight slowly (2-4 seconds). This increases time under tension, a key driver of muscle growth.\nExplosive Concentric Phase: Lift the weight with power (1-2 seconds), focusing on engaging the target muscles.\nPause at Peak Stretch: Hold the weight at the bottom of the movement for 1 second to maximize muscle activation.\nSuperset Rest Period: Rest 60-90 seconds between supersets.\nAccessory Rest Period: Rest 30-60 seconds between accessory sets.\nProgression: Gradually increase weights or reps weekly to maintain progressive overload.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Dumbbell Only"],"minutes":30,"joins":116,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-11-01T17:51:41.092Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Full Body Push","Full Body Pull","Full Body Push","Full Body Pull"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Sumo Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Extension (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Bent Over Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]